WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.330
Hey David, there was recently a controversy
about Michael Bloomberg being called an oligarch.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:12.080
Do you believe Michael Bloomberg is an oligarch?
So what is an oligarch generally defined?

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:17.460
An oligarch is a rich business leader with
a lot of political influence.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:24.060
Now by that definition, of course, Michael
Bloomberg is an oligarch in the United States.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:28.839
The term is more commonly used in Russia and
there's a sort of pejorative sense to the

00:00:28.839 --> 00:00:33.760
word, but that's okay. We'll still use it
and, and, and use it for our analysis here.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:40.380
If you have money to buy your way to 10% support
in a democratic primary, jumping in very,

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:46.190
very late, you are an oligarch in some sense.
And Michael Bloomberg is, he's still better

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.280
than Trump, but in this strict definition,
he is absolutely an oligarch. Now, we have

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:57.390
to recognize that the circumstances for oligarchs
in the United States are very different than

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:03.340
they are in places like Russia and Ukraine
were oligarchs have a degree of control there

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:09.530
that they simply do not have here individual
rich dudes with private armies in Russia and

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:15.060
Ukraine. That is different. And I know people
will say, well, the president gets these mercenaries.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.890
I get it, but we are not talking about the
same thing. Bloomberg is an oligarch in that

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:27.270
he can use his vast wealth to buy his way
into the election, but he still needs to successfully

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:34.120
deploy the money to convince voters to support
him. Otherwise he won't get a single delegate.

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:41.100
He can't simply buy his way into office in
the same way that a Russian Petro billionaire,

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:46.070
Ken, you can buy your way into an ambassadorship
and we see it done quite, quite, quite often.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:51.830
Um, a lot of the difference is really a difference
of degree, right? The level of corruption,

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:57.860
the U S is hugely corrupt in many ways, but
it is not nearly as corrupt as Russia is in

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:03.390
this sense. So I, you know, we've talked before,
why are they called oligarchs in Russia and

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:08.140
just billionaires in the United States? And
that's a fair question. But there is a difference

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.119
and it's not just Russia and Ukraine.

00:02:10.119 --> 00:02:15.549
The term oligarch is less used in some African
nations, but it would certainly apply there

00:02:15.549 --> 00:02:21.579
as well. Uh, in some of the Islamic theocracies
of the middle East. The term oligarch is not

00:02:21.579 --> 00:02:26.420
used that frequently, but it would also apply
in a way that it simply does it in the United

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:31.200
States. But for the standards of the United
States for the level of corruption we have,

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:35.870
which is corrupt, but it's not what exists
in other countries. The U S a you can actually

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:40.769
look at the corruption rankings and see where
we are. Uh, Michael Bloomberg is an oligarch

00:02:40.769 --> 00:02:45.469
by any reasonable American interpretation
of the term, but we still have a very different

00:02:45.469 --> 00:02:50.360
situation here than we do in many other countries.
The people who went crazy when Michael Bloomberg

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:55.389
was called an oligarch, I think it was on
MSNBC or whatever, come on. The guy is essentially

00:02:55.389 --> 00:02:59.610
an oligarch, although that just means something
different here than it means in, for example,

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:32.239
Ukraine or Georgia or the country

00:03:32.239 --> 00:04:05.269
or Russia.

